  "id": "concurrent-validity",
  "term": "concurrent validity",
  "definition": "Concurrent validity is the extent to which a measure shows the expected relationship with another relevant measure assessed at the same time. In the packet, this is illustrated by the TAPAS showing a moderate association with weight stigma.",
